---
title: Design class diagram 2 of 8 - case documents and stage history (Strategies.Api/Data/Models)
---
classDiagram
    direction TB

    class Case {
        <<entity, see diagram 1>>
        +Id: Guid «PK»
        +Stage: CaseStage
    }
    class Document {
        <<entity>>
        +Id: Guid «PK»
        +CaseId: Guid «FK Case»
        +DocumentTypeId: Guid «FK DocumentType»
        +ReviewedById: Guid? «FK User»
        +FileName: string
        +FilePath: string
        +Status: DocumentStatus
        +ReviewComment: string?
        +UploadedAt: DateTime = UtcNow
        +IsArchived: bool = false
    }
    class CaseStageHistory {
        <<entity>>
        +Id: Guid «PK»
        +CaseId: Guid «FK Case»
        +ChangedById: Guid? «FK User»
        +FromStage: CaseStage
        +ToStage: CaseStage
        +ChangedAt: DateTime = UtcNow
    }
    class DocumentType {
        <<entity>>
        +Id: Guid «PK»
        +Name: string
        +Description: string?
    }
    class User {
        <<entity, see diagram 1>>
        +Id: Guid «PK»
    }

    Case "1" *-- "0..*" Document
    Case "1" *-- "0..*" CaseStageHistory
    DocumentType "1" <-- "0..*" Document
    User "0..1" <-- "0..*" Document : reviewer
    User "0..1" <-- "0..*" CaseStageHistory : changed by

    note "No methods: EF Core property classes.<br>Filled diamond = deleted with the case (Cascade).<br>Document to DocumentType: Restrict. Reviewer and<br>changed-by links: SetNull.<br>FilePath is a path on the API host's local disk<br>(wwwroot/uploads); files are not stored in the database."
